      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "When initializing a [`SCNView`](scnview.md) object, use the [`init(frame:options:)`](scnview/init(frame:options:).md) initializer and the [`preferredRenderingAPI`](scnview/option/preferredrenderingapi.md) key. Alternatively, create a view in Interface Builder and use the Rendering API control in the inspector. During initialization, the view will attempt to use the preferred API, but will fall back to a different API if the preferred one is not supported on the current hardware.",
